{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52127","headline":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏 · 上官仪","name":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青丘横日域，碧海贯乾纲。\n奇怪储神府，朝宗擅谷王。\n灵官耀三岳，仙槎泛□□。\n蜃楼朝气上，鷄树早花芳。\n别岛春潮駃，连汀宿雾长。\n惊湍荡云色，沓浪倒霞光。\n宸行肃辽隧，降望临归塘。\n夹林朱鹭澈，分空翠凤翔。\n凭深体嬀后，徒御叶周王。\n游圣沾玄泽，讵假濯沧浪。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}